  "development_history": "Initial compilation rejected non-Copy plan-kind movement and missing NativeCall matches; fixed without changing old profiles. Initial new-parser fixtures incorrectly classified native as installed; corrected fixtures, preserving strict absent native metadata. Zero-match test filter received no coverage credit. First cohort at0af3ff75 stopped at trial3/native on clock-bracket refusal; subsequent failure-only diagnostics observed zero loop CPU:56 prerequisites and trials1-2 passed,62 later trials unrun, no statistics. A finite-CPU-limit diagnostic and upstream accounting trace identified stale group CPU values; shared thread-clock refresh preserves the process metric and all old predicates. Second cohort at794ae10 stopped before timing on a retained-log name collision; every trial remained unrun. Complete campaign-relative log names corrected the source. Third cohort at6c357b0 failed a negative timeout-fixture rescue assertion before timing; detaching the closed-output child makes the existing rescue requirement deterministic against group-kill reaping. This is a new65-process cohort on corrected source; no old observations enter it. All attempts remain preserved privately; compact failed-run facts accompany this receipt.",
